  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_pliers_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>pliers, pincers, usually small, having long jaws mostly with parallel surfaces, sometimes toothed; used for bending wire, manipulating small objects, etc. (OED s.v. plier 2)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
